3890-d310712-r227829582-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Go, with no doubt", "text": "The experince is unique. You can see how the family prepare the body before to burn it, you can see how they burn it and after this they put down the ashes to the river.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2014-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "4232B3F41D4408AC1EB375BDBB76379A", "name": "YRREM", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/YRREM", "username": "YRREM", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e8/91/default-avatar-2020-62.jpg", "contribution_count": 49, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 187454, "location_name": "Bilbao", "location_name_detailed": "Bilbao, Spain"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2014-09-09", "published_at_date": "2014-09-08"}, {"review_id": 227284746, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r227284746-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Feel the culture in Pashupathinath", "text": "Filled with Devotees, Sadhoos, Tourists, Guides,Cows,Corpse Pashupathinath is truly the world's biggest Shiva temple.A must see place in Kathmandu. A Unesco World heritage site.Even though its slightly unclean that doesn't bother when you stand in this holy place. There is a cremation ground in the banks of Bagmati river where the corpse are lined up for their turn. Don't forget to visit the old age home near the temple. If you want to visit the whole temple campus one full day is required.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", 